# WallStreetNinja Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for WallStreetNinja.

WallStreetNinja is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: WallStreetNinja  
Audit type: Token smart contract audit and certificate  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

